	<p style="line-height: 200%">Dust, Mist &amp; Fume Collection solutions for 
	Industrial applications.<!--mstheme--></font><!--msthemelist--></td></tr>
	<!--msthemelist--><tr><td valign="baseline" width="42"><img src="_themes/west-coast/indbul1a.gif" width="15" height="15" hspace="13" alt="bullet"></td><td valign="top" width="100%"><!--mstheme--><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica">
	<p style="line-height: 200%">Complete design &amp; installation<!--mstheme--></font><!--msthemelist--></td></tr>
	<!--msthemelist--><tr><td valign="baseline" width="42"><img src="_themes/west-coast/indbul1a.gif" width="15" height="15" hspace="13" alt="bullet"></td><td valign="top" width="100%"><!--mstheme--><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica">
	<p style="line-height: 200%">Our dust control and ventilation specialists 
	have 25 years of experience cleansing the air for Southern California 
